WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.720
We did it!

00:00:01.720 --> 00:00:04.960
Thank you so much for
helping us 'fill the carrot.'

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:06.400
We reached our goal

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:09.240
with your amazing contributions
to NutritionFacts.org.

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:10.960
Your generous support
enables us

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:14.840
to continue to scour all the
medical and nutrition journals

00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:17.360
so you don’t have to.

00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:20.480
We appreciate each and every
one of our supporters;

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:23.040
you are truly the backbone
of our nonprofit.

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:25.840
Thank you so much for your
dedication and support.

00:00:25.840 --> 00:00:28.880
I can’t wait for another
awesome year.

